## Description

AI video companies are no longer claiming they can simply generate better clips.  They are claiming their models understand the world.  So Peter and I put that claim to the test.  We sat down with Yaron Inger, Co-Founder and CTO of @ltx_io , for a direct conversation about https://t.co/q29HaxRoRv

